  "description": "Cross-platform desktop printing for .NET 10 and Avalonia 12.1.4. Print local or HTTP/HTTPS PDF and images, Avalonia visuals, or paginated documents through a simple API with optional preview. Includes image layouts, PDF export, and Windows GDI, macOS AppKit/PDFKit, and Linux CUPS backends.",
